---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import catalog from '../../data/catalog.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="Trending AI agents — PARADOX" description="Recently catalogued and active public AI agent repositories. Trends are explained; percentages are not invented." canonical="https://paradox.engineer/trending/">
  <main class="agents-page pp-trending-page">
    <header>
      <span>TRENDING / DISCOVERY / LIVE SIGNAL</span>
      <h1>What is moving<br /><em>in public GitHub.</em></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">A curated discovery layer plus live GitHub activity for agent-related projects. PARADOX shows observable signals, not invented popularity scores.</p>
      <div class="pp-trend-strip" aria-label="Trending signals"><div><span>CATALOGUED</span><strong>{catalog.length}</strong><small>curated projects</small></div><div><span>LIVE SEARCH</span><strong>08</strong><small>recent repositories</small></div><div><span>SORTING</span><strong>UPDATE</strong><small>latest GitHub activity</small></div><div><span>METHOD</span><strong>OBSERVED</strong><small>no search-volume claims</small></div></div>
    </header>
    <section><div class="pp-section-head"><div><span>01 / CURATED SIGNAL</span><h2>Catalogued projects.</h2></div><p>Projects selected for relevance to public AI-agent tooling. Each card links to a deeper repository profile.</p></div><div class="grid-2 pp-trend-grid">{catalog.map((e) => (<article class="agent-card"><div class="meta"><span>Recently catalogued</span><span>{e.category}</span></div><h3>{e.owner}/{e.repo}</h3><p>{e.summary}</p><div class="links"><a href={`/agents/${e.owner}/${e.repo}/`}>Open intelligence profile →</a></div></article>))}</div></section>
    <section><div class="pp-section-head"><div><span>02 / LIVE GITHUB</span><h2>Recently updated.</h2></div><p>Observable public activity, sorted by latest update. PARADOX routes live search through its intelligence proxy when configured and keeps a direct fallback.</p></div><p id="trendStatus" class="muted">Connecting to live intelligence…</p><div id="liveTrend" class="grid-2 pp-trend-grid"><p class="muted">Loading live GitHub activity…</p></div></section>
  </main>
  <script>import '../../scripts/trending-page.ts';</script>
</BaseLayout>
